  "为当前 API 账户创建 15 分钟有效的 USDT 充值订单。TRON/BSC 向 address 转账；SOL 必须把 SPL USDT 转入 tokenAccount，address 仅是 owner。必须按 expectedAmount 精确转账，平台以唯一小数匹配链上付款；多付的实际到账金额会按当前规则入账。同一 API key 下同一 Idempotency-Key 只能绑定一组请求参数；安全重试返回原订单且 reused=true。不接受请求体中的回调地址；deposit.updated 只投递到当前账户下预先配置 Webhook URL 且具有 account:read 的 API key。": "Creates a USDT deposit order for the current API account, valid for 15 minutes. For TRON/BSC, transfer to address; for SOL, transfer SPL USDT to tokenAccount, as address is only the owner. Send exactly expectedAmount; the platform matches on-chain payments using unique decimal amounts. Any excess amount actually received is credited under current rules. Each Idempotency-Key under the same API key binds to one set of parameters; safe retries return the original order with reused=true. Callback URLs in the request body are not accepted; deposit.updated is delivered only to API keys under the current account with a preconfigured Webhook URL and account:read scope.",
