  "按 gatewayRef 查询当前 API 账户的充值订单，跨账户访问统一返回 404。status=confirmed 才表示链上付款已确认且钱包已入账；expired 订单仍可因迟到的有效转账变为 confirmed。cancelled 是不可变终态，后续转账不会再匹配该订单或自动入账。Webhook 用于及时通知，本查询接口是订单最终事实来源。": "Looks up the current API account's deposit order by gatewayRef; cross-account access always returns 404. Only status=confirmed means the on-chain payment is confirmed and the wallet credited. An expired order may still become confirmed after a valid late transfer. cancelled is an immutable terminal state; subsequent transfers will not match the order or be credited automatically. Webhooks provide timely notifications; this endpoint is the authoritative source of order status.",
  "充值订单当前状态": "Current deposit order status",
