  "只取消当前 API key 创建、尚未付款且仍有效的订单。无请求体和 Idempotency-Key，按 gatewayRef 资源幂等；重复取消返回 replayed=true。成功返回 200 后，该 gatewayRef 保持 cancelled 不可变终态，后续转账不会再匹配该订单或自动入账；如链上确认在取消竞态中先完成，则返回 409。取消不会复用原订单的精确金额；如需修改金额或网络，必须使用新的 Idempotency-Key 创建新订单。": "Cancels only a still-valid, unpaid order created by the current API key. No request body or Idempotency-Key is required; cancellation is idempotent by gatewayRef, with repeated cancellation returning replayed=true. After HTTP 200, gatewayRef remains in the immutable cancelled terminal state; subsequent transfers will not match or be credited automatically. If on-chain confirmation wins the cancellation race, returns 409. Cancellation does not reuse the original order's exact amount. To change the amount or network, create a new order with a new Idempotency-Key.",
