  "开通一张虚拟卡": "Open one virtual card",
  "当前 count 只能为 1。初始金额必须处于产品返回的 minAmount 与 maxAmount 之间。开卡扣款为 initAmount + openFee + 初始充值手续费；初始充值手续费按 products.rechargeRate 计算并向上取整到 4 位小数。提交前必须原样提交 expectedOpenFee、expectedInitialRechargeFee 与 openQuoteVersion；报价变化时返回 409 / PRICE_CHANGED，重新读取 products 后以新幂等键提交。": "count must currently be 1. The initial amount must be between the product's minAmount and maxAmount. The opening debit equals initAmount + openFee + initial top-up fee. The initial top-up fee is calculated using products.rechargeRate and rounded up to 4 decimal places. Submit expectedOpenFee, expectedInitialRechargeFee, and openQuoteVersion exactly as quoted. A changed quote returns 409 / PRICE_CHANGED; retrieve products again and submit with a new idempotency key.",
