  "自动取消续费按当前API Key的设置固定到新订单，默认开启；在开发者页面关闭后跳过本站自动取消步骤。若在GPT中重新开启自动续费，下个账单日仍可能扣款。使用当前预检结果创建订单。cardId>0 使用本人 ACTIVE 卡；cardId=0 时只能且必须提供 externalCard 或 autoCard。受理202不是支付成功；请求超时先查询或使用原 Idempotency-Key 重放，禁止为同一支付意图换键重下。": "The current API key's automatic renewal cancellation setting is fixed on each new order and defaults to enabled. Disabling it on the developer page skips the platform's automatic cancellation step. If renewal is re-enabled in GPT, the next billing date may still incur a charge. Create the order using the current preflight result. cardId>0 uses your own ACTIVE card; cardId=0 requires exactly one of externalCard or autoCard. 202 acceptance does not mean payment succeeded. After a timeout, query the order or replay with the original Idempotency-Key. Never create another order with a new key for the same payment intent.",
